## in-view.soar -- thor-soar: 4 elaborations.

## Elaborate state scene property-in-view false -> sets in-view.
sp {elaborations*elaborate*state*scene*property-in-view*false
    :default
   (state <s> ^superstate nil
              ^scene.objects.object <object-int>)
   (<object-int> -^in-view true)
-->
   (<object-int> ^in-view false)
}

